=A. Commitment to factual accuracy#Correct. This answer applies the lesson standard to journalism practice.
~B. Use of the same font#Review the scenario and standard. This choice does not best support accurate journalism practice.
~C. Avoidance of sources#Review the scenario and standard. This choice does not best support accurate journalism practice.
